  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-little-dinosaur-halloween-v1-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b3274ac859583e60fbc9c664fc75bd9a668e7b2fc268b92beb67e4785d441a80",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "685dc07ccf0c147a878664ebb41e13cc421a7c68523453dfa1e4eb1991130da6",
      "text": "悟空的小恐龙万圣夜",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e6a8537af1fc224af7b13e902f29a52dc825a3fa88ed31a76e86ee2cd54febfa",
      "text": "今天是万圣节晚上。\n悟空穿上他的服装：\n绿色的尖刺，长长的绿尾巴……\n“我是一只恐龙！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "72a9273371bb4d1eecedfffc41eec892c167e0a128584a0c6c8b7f5bc1471d91",
      "text": "他对着镜子练习：\n“嗷——呜！”\n八戒捂住耳朵，\n哈哈大笑。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "206d35b0729cae991b50ba520c4908388e0cc3e7c6560442366b0ffbd3b55b32",
      "text": "玉兔拍拍她的蝙蝠小翅膀，\n沙僧提着一盏小灯笼。\n“准备好了吗？”“准备好了！”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5f6f6118efb1eb651771bf0f982cc2d3bee5c136fff907768a9e2db340cd119b",
      "text": "街上亮起橙色的光，\n每家门口的台阶上\n都有笑眯眯的南瓜灯。\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9eba07f1f4dc5e049b3e987b2296ed9403503c5cee055a0f3e1416328efdf30c",
      "text": "叮咚！\n悟空按响第一家的门铃。\n谁会来开门呢？\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "322453107920f26178a13db489f19f234863c4a495e93b60b507b87eb049d7f1",
      "text": "“嗷——呜！”悟空大喊一声。\n一只小小的刺猬\n躲到了爷爷身后。\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "90f6dfb679fbca473ef24fef3be77cdf0c158b2e39c47d3fb6b51ed9d728a7ea",
      "text": "悟空停了下来。\n小刺猬被吓到了。\n他慢慢蹲下来。\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d81d8d335c0aaa1021d7b73691d99506cb513c7f1be8c506fa178df6b2bb213e",
      "text": "他小小声地说：“嗷呜……\n不给糖就捣蛋！”\n还挥了挥恐龙小爪子。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a01f58ec5bed273032b5568f44de669cd7578e29ba6105cbc559d0e5ac7b66ba",
      "text": "小刺猬不害怕了，\n咯咯笑着往每个小桶里放\n一颗糖。\n“谢谢！”大家一起说。\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bcfa0dbc100f04afa9e25a199ee1bc13b67e856ccf1b9300b193410adab7ea7a",
      "text": "下一家是唐僧家。\n按门铃，\n“不给糖就捣蛋！”\n拿一颗，说：“谢谢！”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d1c3809e367555851bc05407905d0ed0c87f4098f146c6e5e0e45b4c16d4e23",
      "text": "到了月洞门小院，\n嫦娥捧着一大碗糖。\n八戒看着满满一碗糖，\n只拿了一颗。\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "84ad59a2670b095b8a3fb3d570d9f16947f7a43f2b92ab5eff1cf8da6c8df6d6",
      "text": "沙僧的灯笼一闪一闪的。\n他笑着拿出一节\n备用小电池：\n“我早就准备好啦。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3d3d1bfa463723a2624b4161231ad1a31b678bcb6cd8b7bf3d183d275088b827",
      "text": "回到家，悟空把糖倒出来：\n一、二、三！\n他分了一颗给沙僧。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "11bcf64e4c0cdc0e1f0f6dd5e1e41b6129f68204793595acf74d41be47090af3",
      "text": "沙僧问：“给我的吗？”\n悟空说：\n“因为你陪我们走了一路呀！”\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8eb605e81c65b76c379bd66d859fc39690f3fb88f46a7afa403deea04b4bf3f9",
      "text": "悟空打了一个大大的哈欠，\n恐龙帽滑了下来。\n他小小声地说：“嗷呜。”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
